{save true}{false}ifelse}{false}ifelse
11 dict begin
/FontType 1 def
/FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0 ]readonly def
/FontName /NALIBP+CMR12 def
/FontBBox {-34 -251 988 750 }readonly def
/PaintType 0 def
